<li><strong>Get fingerprinted.</strong> Texas requires fingerprints for a background check before the license is issued.</li>
<li><strong>Apply through TDI.</strong> Submit your application and fee online through Sircon or NIPR, listing Texas as your home state or DHS.</li>
<li><strong>Keep it active.</strong> Licenses renew every two years, and you must complete continuing education hours before each renewal.</li>
